WEBVTT

01:31.720 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:49.360 --> 01:51.000
Chant the curse
and repel the Ignorance Demon!

02:23.800 --> 02:24.880
Ling,

02:25.400 --> 02:26.960
you see that I didn't lie to you, right?

02:27.560 --> 02:28.600
I told you

02:29.120 --> 02:31.040
that if you don't come back
to Dark Abyss in a month,

02:31.120 --> 02:34.560
your demonic energy
will split your body up.

02:35.560 --> 02:38.040
You've been in the human world
for half a month now.

02:38.560 --> 02:41.080
The retribution has begun.

02:42.160 --> 02:43.120
Ling,

02:43.640 --> 02:44.600
this is the day.

02:45.320 --> 02:47.360
Help Ignorance Demon
to get the Chaos Pearl

02:47.440 --> 02:48.720
and get back to the Dark Abyss.

02:48.800 --> 02:50.200
Come back to me.

02:50.720 --> 02:52.680
There's nothing for you
in the human world.

02:53.200 --> 02:54.080
Nothing.

02:54.160 --> 02:57.600
Humans built all their glories

02:57.680 --> 02:58.880
upon the bodies of other clans.

02:58.960 --> 03:03.000
They are always insatiable

03:03.520 --> 03:04.880
and lack of self-awareness.

03:05.560 --> 03:08.560
They are the worst in all the evilness.

03:08.640 --> 03:10.200
They shouldn't exist.

03:10.960 --> 03:11.800
Remember.

03:12.560 --> 03:15.440
Finish your task
and get back to the Dark Abyss.

03:15.520 --> 03:17.280
Come back to me.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.800
That's the only way you will live.

03:19.880 --> 03:20.960
Go back to the Dark Abyss.

03:23.080 --> 03:24.400
Go back to the Dark Abyss.

03:24.480 --> 03:25.440
Ms. Mu!

03:25.520 --> 03:26.360
Ms. Mu!

03:37.400 --> 03:38.320
Qiumin!

03:38.400 --> 03:39.560
-Mu Xuanling!
-Miss Gao!

03:51.960 --> 03:54.000
If any of you dare to say one more word
from the curse,

03:54.080 --> 03:55.440
she will be dead.

03:55.520 --> 03:57.800
Mu Xuanling! Are you insane?

03:58.440 --> 03:59.480
Let me go!

04:01.560 --> 04:03.800
You've been looking for the traitor
in the Immortal Alliance, right?

04:04.400 --> 04:05.640
Let me give you a hint.

04:05.720 --> 04:09.280
There's another one among you
who has been colluding with the Dark Clan.

04:10.120 --> 04:11.560
The one you trust the most,

04:12.880 --> 04:14.400
Mr. Xie!

04:15.480 --> 04:16.920
Ridiculous!

04:17.440 --> 04:19.760
You are just trying to sow discord
in the Immortal Alliance.

04:19.839 --> 04:21.279
It is not baseless.

04:22.000 --> 04:25.480
The one standing in front of you
is the Saintess of Dark Abyss.

04:25.560 --> 04:27.920
The direct disciple of His Grace, Sang Qi.

04:28.000 --> 04:30.960
It was Xie Xuechen
who brought her back to the Snow City.

04:31.040 --> 04:33.320
You don't have to take my word for it.
Just ask him.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.280
Yes.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.600
Told you so.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.440
The golden boy of humanity

04:45.520 --> 04:48.200
colluded with the Saintess
of the Dark Abyss.

04:51.160 --> 04:52.160
Mu Xuanling!

04:52.800 --> 04:54.000
Let her go!

04:54.080 --> 04:55.240
Surrender the Chaos Pearl

04:56.240 --> 04:57.640
and remove the barrier.

04:59.200 --> 05:01.280
You are already unconscious

05:01.360 --> 05:04.440
and yet you won't say
anything cruel to him.

05:06.280 --> 05:07.400
Fine.

05:08.400 --> 05:11.080
Let me help you.

05:14.800 --> 05:18.200
Surrender the Chaos Pearl
and remove the barrier.

05:18.720 --> 05:21.800
Otherwise, all of them will die.

05:22.840 --> 05:24.160
Mu Xuanling!

05:25.720 --> 05:27.720
Mu Xuanling will not kill them.

05:29.600 --> 05:31.560
Mu Xuanling may not,

05:32.160 --> 05:35.840
but Mr. Xie, how about you?

05:41.800 --> 05:43.080
A recording stone!

05:43.160 --> 05:46.760
The lord of the Jade Sky Palace
truly lives up to the name

05:46.840 --> 05:48.080
of the artifact encyclopedia.

05:48.760 --> 05:50.080
Recording stones

05:50.160 --> 05:52.720
are stone shards from when the ladder
to the celestial world collapsed

05:52.800 --> 05:54.360
tens of thousands of years ago.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.960
It can record true sounds and images.

05:57.040 --> 06:00.240
No cultivator can change that,
no matter how powerful.

06:00.760 --> 06:02.440
That means

06:03.160 --> 06:05.360
what's recorded by the stone

06:06.160 --> 06:07.160
is real.

06:09.760 --> 06:11.840
You witch! What is this about?

06:11.920 --> 06:13.240
Let Qiumin go!

06:13.320 --> 06:14.600
Calm down.

06:15.200 --> 06:17.080
The whole gang is here today.

06:17.600 --> 06:22.760
Let me show you a ten-year-long secret.

06:32.600 --> 06:35.120
-What?
-How?

06:48.440 --> 06:49.520
Father!

07:21.520 --> 07:22.640
Xie Xuechen.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.400
Tell me why.

07:24.480 --> 07:27.040
Why did you kill my father!?

07:30.920 --> 07:32.920
Mr. Xie won't explain.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.760
Let me help you with that.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.560
Ten years ago,

07:37.640 --> 07:40.640
a young cultivator
left the mountain to hone his skills.

07:40.720 --> 07:43.440
He passed by the surrounding area
of Moonlight Heights

07:43.960 --> 07:45.800
and decided to stay there last minute.

07:45.880 --> 07:49.640
That night happens to be the night
Sang Qi attacked the place.

07:50.160 --> 07:52.280
Our young cultivator went to help,

07:52.800 --> 07:56.400
but instead of doing that,
he was possessed by a Dark Clan member

07:56.480 --> 07:58.000
because his faith was not strong enough.

07:58.080 --> 08:00.520
He killed the then-leader

08:00.600 --> 08:03.480
of the Immortal Alliance,
Gao Fengxu, with Klicks.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.960
On the same night,

08:05.040 --> 08:07.960
the young cultivator's father
also rushed here to help

08:08.560 --> 08:11.320
and saw his son
killing the alliance leader.

08:11.400 --> 08:14.720
Justice lost to sentiments.

08:14.800 --> 08:17.080
His father cleared
the alliance leader's wound

08:17.760 --> 08:21.080
of the aura of Klicks
before anyone noticed it

08:21.600 --> 08:22.520
and kept the incident of his son

08:22.600 --> 08:25.120
killing someone after being possessed
by a Dark Clan member.

08:25.840 --> 08:27.840
Yet his conscience is troubled.

08:28.360 --> 08:31.280
He punished the young cultivator
to review his actions on Snow Cliff

08:31.800 --> 08:33.440
for seven years.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.480
I gave you Klicks,

08:35.559 --> 08:38.919
along with the fate of the world.

08:39.000 --> 08:43.600
Yet you used it to kill your allies
and committed this serious crime.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.560
So?

08:48.560 --> 08:49.960
How do you

08:50.880 --> 08:52.240
like the story?

09:01.640 --> 09:03.080
I don't remember

09:04.480 --> 09:05.840
anything about that day.

09:07.120 --> 09:09.360
That is the symptom
of being possessed by a Dark Clan member.

09:10.360 --> 09:11.840
See that?

09:12.480 --> 09:15.360
There you have that Mr. Xie,
who you trust the most.

09:15.440 --> 09:18.160
He's just an ordinary person

09:18.240 --> 09:21.160
who killed his innocent allies
because of a lack of faith.

09:22.640 --> 09:24.560
Aren't you worried

09:25.440 --> 09:27.480
that he will lead you to a fate of death?

09:27.560 --> 09:29.040
Don't listen to her bewitching words.

09:29.640 --> 09:32.480
She's a witch from the Dark Abyss.
We can't take her word for it.

09:32.560 --> 09:36.320
Not everything we see is the truth.

09:36.400 --> 09:39.440
Besides,
it's just an image left by a stone.

09:40.120 --> 09:43.040
But you can't fake things
with a recording stone.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.360
You…

09:49.240 --> 09:50.240
You see what's happening?

09:50.920 --> 09:52.440
Not even one person

09:52.960 --> 09:55.040
in the whole Immortal Alliance
dares to speak up for your father.

09:56.240 --> 09:58.080
Do you know why?

09:58.680 --> 10:00.160
Because it is Xie Xuechen

10:01.160 --> 10:02.360
who killed him.

10:06.800 --> 10:09.800
You witch! Stop disturbing our minds
with your wicked words.

10:10.600 --> 10:13.200
Ignorance Demon. Everyone is here today.

10:13.280 --> 10:14.880
It's the time to eliminate them all.

10:15.520 --> 10:17.400
Fajian has accumulated 500 years of power.

10:17.480 --> 10:19.560
The golden essence in his body is mighty.

10:19.640 --> 10:21.480
To detonate it

10:22.000 --> 10:24.520
will bring half Snow City down with you.

10:25.040 --> 10:27.280
That's a new solution.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.840
Let's go big.

10:44.200 --> 10:46.000
Nan Xuyue, reinforce the barrier!

10:48.240 --> 10:49.120
Nan Xuyue!

10:50.480 --> 10:52.880
Even if I die in the Lofty Cloud Array,

10:52.960 --> 10:54.760
you are not removing the barrier today.

11:20.760 --> 11:22.400
An insignificant artifact…

11:23.960 --> 11:25.760
Cannot stop me.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.760
Disciples of Snow City! Join the array!

11:48.600 --> 11:49.560
-Yes.
-Yes.

11:51.520 --> 11:53.200
Disciples of Snow City, Cui Miaomiao,
joins the array!

11:53.280 --> 11:54.800
Disciples of Snow City, Wang Zheng,
joins the array!

11:54.880 --> 11:56.280
Disciples of Snow City, Jing Sheng,
joins the array!

11:56.360 --> 11:58.800
Disciples of Snow City, Chun Feng,
joins the array!

11:58.880 --> 12:01.760
Mu Xuanling, Disciple of Snow City,
join the array!

12:01.840 --> 12:04.280
Mu Xuanling, Disciple of Snow City,
join the array!

12:04.360 --> 12:07.040
Mu Xuanling, Disciple of Snow City,
join the array!

12:07.120 --> 12:10.000
Mu Xuanling, Disciple of Snow City,
join the array!

12:10.080 --> 12:11.720
Mu Xuanling, join the array!

12:11.800 --> 12:12.880
Mu Xuanling, join the array!

12:12.960 --> 12:14.120
Mu Xuanling, join the array!

12:14.200 --> 12:15.320
Mu Xuanling, join the array!

12:15.920 --> 12:18.760
Your temperament
is not compatible with Snow City.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.840
That's why

12:21.360 --> 12:23.640
you will be starting
from the basic external disciple.

12:23.720 --> 12:25.960
You shall refine your characteristics
and start anew.

12:27.520 --> 12:29.920
Mu Xuanling, Disciple of Snow City,
join the array!

12:30.000 --> 12:33.160
As a disciple of Snow City,
you can't be so downhearted.

12:33.880 --> 12:35.320
But I joined the sect
earlier than you did.

12:35.400 --> 12:36.440
You are a junior.

12:36.520 --> 12:38.840
Mu Xuanling, Disciple of Snow City,
join the array!

12:39.840 --> 12:42.760
Did you say that you want
to leave the Dark Abyss

12:42.840 --> 12:44.680
and live a normal life?

12:44.760 --> 12:46.040
I believed you.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.640
That's why I brought you to Snow City.

12:48.240 --> 12:50.560
You can live a normal life here.

12:50.640 --> 12:51.920
If you believe it,

12:53.120 --> 12:54.000
the way will reveal itself.

12:54.680 --> 12:55.720
Mu Xuanling.

12:56.240 --> 12:59.680
When we have a chance,
I'll show you the real human world.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.520
Xie Xuechen.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.400
Xie Xuechen!

13:48.400 --> 13:49.840
Xie Xuechen!

13:51.360 --> 13:52.240
Nan Xuyue!

14:23.520 --> 14:24.760
Xie Xuechen…

14:42.960 --> 14:44.040
Ling,

14:48.120 --> 14:50.040
you are such a disappointment.

14:51.560 --> 14:53.240
Why are you doing this?

14:54.280 --> 14:55.920
You can't make up your mind,

14:57.000 --> 14:59.080
so I cut him loose for you.

14:59.600 --> 15:00.840
What's wrong with that?

15:05.760 --> 15:10.160
You weren't possessed
by a Dark Clan member.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.560
You have doubts about humanity

15:13.640 --> 15:14.880
and you hate the Immortal Alliance
deep down.

15:14.960 --> 15:17.680
That's why you couldn't resist
the demonic melody

15:17.760 --> 15:20.360
and handed your conscience to me.

15:20.440 --> 15:22.240
You must have heard it all.

15:23.000 --> 15:24.600
Back then,

15:24.680 --> 15:28.040
Xie Xuechen was possessed
by a Dark Clan member.

15:28.640 --> 15:29.840
That means

15:29.920 --> 15:32.240
the person on your mind
for the last ten years

15:32.320 --> 15:33.720
was not him.

15:33.800 --> 15:35.840
If you knew that,

15:36.360 --> 15:38.800
-why didn't you tell me?
-Because hatred

15:40.480 --> 15:41.880
makes you powerful.

15:41.960 --> 15:45.960
Hatred gives you the strength to survive
in the Dark Abyss.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.200
Where is that person?

15:51.120 --> 15:52.640
Where did he go after that night?

15:54.680 --> 15:57.760
I've never met him
in the Dark Abyss over the last ten years.

16:00.680 --> 16:03.480
When a Dark Clan member dies,
his spirit will return to the Void Sea.

16:04.280 --> 16:07.480
No one knows
when the spirit will gain a physical form.

16:07.560 --> 16:09.520
Maybe tomorrow or the day after tomorrow.

16:10.480 --> 16:14.120
Maybe a hundred years
or a thousand years later.

16:16.280 --> 16:18.240
You need to be patient.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.160
Ling,

16:20.880 --> 16:21.840
you should get back

16:22.880 --> 16:25.080
to the Dark Abyss for his sake.

16:36.400 --> 16:37.880
You are hesitating.

16:39.160 --> 16:40.760
Because of Xie Xuechen.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.600
So,

16:42.680 --> 16:45.080
you learned
that Xie Xuechen was not that guy,

16:45.160 --> 16:47.320
yet you were willing to die with him.

16:51.560 --> 16:52.600
Absurd!

16:57.320 --> 17:00.840
My life is my decision.

17:01.360 --> 17:05.440
Even you don't have
the right to decide for me.

17:09.000 --> 17:09.920
Ling,

17:11.359 --> 17:14.640
I feel sad hearing that.

17:15.720 --> 17:18.720
I thought you'd lost
the ability to feel long ago.

17:19.560 --> 17:21.240
On the day you lost your arm.

17:27.680 --> 17:29.240
I'm sticking to the path I chose.

17:29.320 --> 17:31.760
-Even if it leads to a dead end?
-Yes.

17:34.120 --> 17:35.200
Then get lost.

17:41.000 --> 17:43.520
She's Sang Qi's disciple
and a witch from the Dark Abyss.

17:43.600 --> 17:44.640
We can't spare her life!

17:45.160 --> 17:46.520
According to the law
of the Immortal Alliance,

17:46.600 --> 17:47.880
she should be executed right away.

17:47.960 --> 17:50.280
She was just controlled
by the demonic energy.

17:50.920 --> 17:52.480
It's a fact that she was a demon.

17:53.080 --> 17:54.960
If she can be controlled,
then this will repeat.

17:55.840 --> 17:58.920
Sang Qi's disciple
will never turn to the bright side.

17:59.000 --> 18:01.960
-Never give the evilness chances.
-Master!

18:09.520 --> 18:13.320
Mr. Xie, are you seriously
defending the witch?

18:23.040 --> 18:24.400
She has never done anything evil.

18:25.280 --> 18:26.240
This shouldn't be her fate.

18:26.880 --> 18:29.560
If evil deeds are deemed innocent
because one is controlled,

18:29.640 --> 18:32.560
then how is it fair
to the deceased Saint Fajian?

18:32.640 --> 18:35.640
Madam Su, are you referring
to Mu Xuanling or me?

18:36.240 --> 18:38.960
You should answer to Mr. Gao's death.

18:42.560 --> 18:46.040
I will give you an answer
to what happened to Gao Fengxu.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.160
Gao Fengxu

18:52.000 --> 18:53.120
had it coming.

18:53.920 --> 18:56.040
-Mu Xuanling!
-Ten years ago,

18:56.120 --> 18:57.800
I was in Moonlight Heights

18:57.880 --> 19:00.120
as a slave when Sang Qi attacked.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.680
Gao Fengxu tried to kill me.

19:03.480 --> 19:05.720
A Dark Clan member killed him to save me.

19:06.920 --> 19:08.440
Total nonsense!

19:08.960 --> 19:10.160
What do the leader
of the Immortal Alliance

19:10.240 --> 19:11.720
care about an insignificant slave?

19:13.880 --> 19:16.400
Do you think Gao Fengxu is a decent man?

19:17.400 --> 19:19.800
As the leader of the Immortal Alliance,

19:19.880 --> 19:23.040
he set an example of oppressing
and bullying the Spirit Clan.

19:23.120 --> 19:25.240
He may look like an upright man,

19:25.320 --> 19:28.000
but he's just a hypocritical

19:28.080 --> 19:30.320
and ruthless scoundrel.

19:31.280 --> 19:33.320
On the night Sang Qi attacked,

19:33.400 --> 19:35.160
he lost his mind over the killings.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.920
Because of I'm a Spirit Clan,

19:37.000 --> 19:39.920
he tried to kill me, regardless
of the fact that I did nothing.

19:40.680 --> 19:43.200
A Dark Clan member can't watch him
bullying a young girl

19:43.280 --> 19:45.200
and helped me.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.400
What did he do wrong?

19:48.000 --> 19:50.000
Mu Xuanling!
How dare you slander my father!

19:50.080 --> 19:52.720
You lived with him for ten years.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.760
Don't you know what he's like?

19:55.840 --> 19:59.440
What about you? What were you doing?

20:01.080 --> 20:03.120
Why pretend that you were
in a good relationship now?

20:03.960 --> 20:05.720
You are just two peas in a pod.

20:05.800 --> 20:08.040
-Mu Xuanling!
-Ladies!

20:08.760 --> 20:11.560
No one has seen what happened to Mr. Gao.

20:11.640 --> 20:13.960
It's pointless to keep arguing.
Am I right?

20:15.800 --> 20:16.880
Yes.

20:16.960 --> 20:19.520
It has been ten years
since Mr. Gao passed away.

20:19.600 --> 20:23.120
We can't allow his name
to be smudged because of a few words.

20:23.960 --> 20:25.440
Mr. Xie's fault

20:26.120 --> 20:27.880
is that his faith was not strong enough

20:27.960 --> 20:29.920
and allowed a Dark Clan member
to possess him.

20:30.680 --> 20:33.160
Defending the Dark Clan at all times
is difficult for everyone.

20:33.240 --> 20:34.080
Otherwise,

20:34.160 --> 20:38.320
-Saint Fajian wouldn't have…
-Mr. Xie.

20:42.640 --> 20:43.920
Am I right?

20:44.000 --> 20:47.760
In addition, Mr. Xie stood before
the exploding golden essence

20:47.840 --> 20:50.720
and saved everyone here along
with half the city.

20:51.840 --> 20:54.640
How could we judge his faults and merits?

20:59.360 --> 21:02.280
We will discuss
Mr. Gao's death another day.

21:03.080 --> 21:04.600
Our focus right now should be

21:04.680 --> 21:08.640
how to deal with
the Saintess of the Dark Abyss.

21:21.880 --> 21:23.200
Restrain Mu Xuanling's power

21:24.480 --> 21:26.120
and lock her up in the Frozen Dungeon.

21:27.440 --> 21:30.880
We shall discuss what to do later.

21:31.480 --> 21:33.600
-Mr. Xie…
-I said

21:33.680 --> 21:35.520
that we'll discuss it later.

21:57.600 --> 21:59.320
You and him are so similar.

22:00.280 --> 22:03.400
But why you are not him?

22:03.480 --> 22:04.960
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

22:15.520 --> 22:16.920
Xuechen. The Immortal Alliance…

22:31.960 --> 22:33.120
Xuechen!

22:58.440 --> 22:59.640
Xuechen!

23:07.600 --> 23:10.240
Saint Fajian owned great power.

23:11.760 --> 23:15.000
You used your primordial spirit
to resist his self-exploding.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.680
You were looking for death.

23:24.440 --> 23:27.080
Jun Tian Sword took half of the impact.

23:27.840 --> 23:29.200
I will live.

23:32.000 --> 23:35.760
If it weren't for the Jun Tian Sword,
you'd be dead on the spot.

23:37.040 --> 23:37.920
Xuyue.

23:39.120 --> 23:40.280
Xuyue.

23:41.920 --> 23:45.160
Don't let anyone know about my injury.

23:46.040 --> 23:47.400
You are worried that Sang Qi might strike.

23:48.440 --> 23:50.200
Fajian's self-explosion

23:51.160 --> 23:52.960
has put a crack on the Pearl Tower.

23:53.600 --> 23:55.280
We can't let anything happen
to the Chaos Pearl.

23:56.000 --> 23:59.600
As long as I'm all right, Sang Qi
will think twice before making moves.

24:07.040 --> 24:08.440
As long as you are all right,

24:09.200 --> 24:10.880
Immortal Alliance
will think twice as well,

24:12.320 --> 24:13.880
and you will keep Mu Xuanling safe.

24:14.760 --> 24:15.600
Right?

24:24.480 --> 24:26.040
In the Hall of Integrity,

24:26.120 --> 24:28.240
all the sects wanted Mu Xuanling dead.

24:28.320 --> 24:30.960
If you didn't toughen up
and control the situation,

24:31.040 --> 24:32.160
they would have

24:33.280 --> 24:34.960
killed Mu Xuanling on the spot.

24:38.320 --> 24:42.160
Even so, we have to keep her
in the dungeon for the time being.

24:44.000 --> 24:47.320
She has never done anything evil.
This shouldn't be her fate.

24:56.080 --> 24:59.400
But there are abnormalities in her body.

25:01.600 --> 25:03.040
I checked her pulse.

25:03.560 --> 25:05.200
The demonic energy is stirring up
in her body

25:06.080 --> 25:08.240
and pulling her internal channels apart.

25:08.840 --> 25:10.320
Her spiritual apertures are damaged.

25:12.240 --> 25:14.400
I don't know how long
she can keep holding on.

26:22.320 --> 26:23.760
The retribution of the demonic energy

26:24.440 --> 26:28.320
makes the sunshine untouchable for me
in the last half month.

26:31.320 --> 26:32.440
Why do I have to go through this?

26:33.000 --> 26:36.160
I don't want to live
like pests in the sewer.

27:01.800 --> 27:03.000
Mr. Xie,

27:03.720 --> 27:05.120
you shouldn't be here.

27:14.040 --> 27:15.440
What happened to you?

27:18.720 --> 27:19.760
It's just a scratch.

27:20.560 --> 27:23.640
Compared to your injury, this is nothing.

27:24.560 --> 27:25.960
Now that the wristband is broken,

27:26.040 --> 27:29.360
you are not transferring
my wounds to you again.

27:31.080 --> 27:32.320
Xie Xuechen.

27:33.600 --> 27:34.560
I'll be honest with you.

27:36.040 --> 27:37.520
I don't have much time left.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.080
So,

27:41.320 --> 27:42.600
kill me.

27:44.200 --> 27:47.720
Prove that you have strong faith
with my life.

27:48.360 --> 27:50.720
That will put an end to the statement
of you colluding with the Dark Clan.

27:52.480 --> 27:53.560
Kill me,

27:54.960 --> 27:56.600
and you can keep being

27:57.480 --> 27:59.160
the fair

27:59.880 --> 28:01.040
representative of justice.

28:03.840 --> 28:07.000
You have never done anything evil.
You shouldn't die.

28:09.080 --> 28:10.800
What is justice?

28:11.960 --> 28:14.120
If I can't save one person,
how can I save the world?

28:14.920 --> 28:15.960
I told you

28:17.000 --> 28:20.000
that when there's hope, there's a way.

28:20.520 --> 28:22.520
You are in this situation because of me.

28:23.680 --> 28:25.440
Why aren't you mad?

28:26.120 --> 28:27.280
Xie Xuechen.

28:28.920 --> 28:30.760
I'm not as kind as you think.

28:32.280 --> 28:33.640
I lost my conscious today
to the demonic power

28:33.720 --> 28:35.440
because there's a demon inside of me.

28:36.040 --> 28:37.160
If it weren't for…

28:40.800 --> 28:42.200
the bond I have with this world,

28:43.560 --> 28:47.200
I might have put an end
to the Immortal Alliance and humanity.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.480
Mu Xuanling.

29:02.440 --> 29:04.680
I've been thinking about a question

29:06.320 --> 29:08.160
since the day we met.

29:10.080 --> 29:11.800
Why were you so persistent about me?

29:12.800 --> 29:14.680
I got my answer today.

29:17.600 --> 29:18.960
It wasn't me

29:20.520 --> 29:21.960
who had been on your mind.

29:28.200 --> 29:29.440
Yes.

29:33.480 --> 29:35.280
It was that big brother.

29:36.640 --> 29:38.360
I owe him my life.

29:50.640 --> 29:52.160
But today,

29:52.920 --> 29:54.400
I wasn't thinking about him.

29:56.680 --> 29:57.800
I was thinking about…

30:07.480 --> 30:10.680
Considering the situation we are in,
there's no point talking about this.

30:11.560 --> 30:13.080
Can you bring me some snacks

30:13.160 --> 30:14.680
and delicious liquor?

30:15.400 --> 30:18.040
When I finish my last delicious meal,
you should kill me.

30:22.280 --> 30:23.480
Xie Xuechen.

30:24.200 --> 30:25.040
I'm telling you to kill…

30:40.040 --> 30:41.200
Mu Xuanling!

30:42.040 --> 30:43.480
I'm not letting you die.

30:48.000 --> 30:49.480
It's not up to you

30:52.120 --> 30:53.480
to decide.

30:56.520 --> 30:58.240
You should learn

30:59.640 --> 31:02.160
how to make use of things for the best
from the Jade Sky Palace.

31:06.800 --> 31:09.440
Xie Xuechen. You should go.

31:10.080 --> 31:12.160
I hope that the next time we meet

31:13.720 --> 31:15.200
is the time that you kill me.

31:17.600 --> 31:19.240
I will not let you die.

31:39.080 --> 31:40.240
Xie Xuechen.

31:43.360 --> 31:44.800
There is no chance for me

31:47.200 --> 31:49.560
to see the real human world with you.

31:53.160 --> 31:56.160
HALL OF SAINTS

31:57.920 --> 31:59.360
You knew, didn't you?

31:59.960 --> 32:03.360
When I asked you how the puppet incident
in Mirage Palace ended,

32:03.440 --> 32:05.480
your answer was vague.

32:05.560 --> 32:07.680
You were covering for her, weren't you?

32:08.280 --> 32:09.360
I wasn't, Master.

32:09.440 --> 32:10.920
I didn't know that
she was the Saintess of the Dark Abyss.

32:11.000 --> 32:12.960
She did use her demonic power
to save everyone.

32:13.040 --> 32:14.520
But she's a Spirit Clan member.

32:15.960 --> 32:18.160
You covered up for a Spirit Clan member.

32:18.800 --> 32:20.480
Her kind knows how to lure people.

32:23.880 --> 32:26.840
Sang Qi must have asked that witch
to get close to Xie Xuechen

32:27.920 --> 32:30.800
to hinder Xie Xuechen's cultivation.

32:31.480 --> 32:33.720
Xie Xuechen was trapped in the Dark Abyss

32:33.800 --> 32:35.280
and held up under the Lave.

32:35.360 --> 32:37.160
What's the point of complicating things?

32:38.120 --> 32:39.280
What do you know?

32:40.560 --> 32:43.440
Sang Qi is a treacherous man.

32:43.520 --> 32:45.280
Messing with people's minds
is fun for him.

32:46.120 --> 32:48.520
Sang Qi is the nemesis
of the Mirage Palace.

32:49.120 --> 32:51.240
This vendetta will only end with death.

32:53.040 --> 32:57.520
I will not let him or that witch off.

32:59.960 --> 33:03.240
-Master. Has Sang Qi tricked you before?
-Ridiculous!

33:11.640 --> 33:13.960
He's just a low Spirit Clan member.

33:14.640 --> 33:17.280
He's no match for members
of the Mirage Palace.

33:18.480 --> 33:19.320
Master.

33:19.960 --> 33:23.000
Your hatred against Sang Qi
is a little too strong.

33:24.920 --> 33:25.760
Qiumin.

33:26.400 --> 33:28.840
You should hate him, too. You have to.

33:29.720 --> 33:32.520
He brought a massacre on Moonlight Heights
and he's the reason your mom is dead.

33:33.280 --> 33:35.560
You said that my mom died
when giving birth to me.

33:41.040 --> 33:43.120
I have misspoken.

33:44.040 --> 33:46.480
I'm tired. You should leave me.

34:00.320 --> 34:05.120
HALL OF SAINTS

34:43.400 --> 34:45.239
Is this barrier useless?

34:45.320 --> 34:46.880
How did you get in here?

34:47.920 --> 34:49.320
The barrier of the Frozen Dungeon

34:49.400 --> 34:51.600
is meant to trap the prisoners.

34:51.679 --> 34:55.239
Good people like me
can come and go freely.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.920
Good people.

35:01.720 --> 35:05.600
Good lady, what are you doing here?

35:05.680 --> 35:09.520
Even if I am to be killed,
you shouldn't be the executor.

35:10.640 --> 35:11.480
Mu Xuanling.

35:11.560 --> 35:14.480
You are in this situation
all thanks to that mouth of yours.

35:16.160 --> 35:20.160
My good ladyship, you are not here

35:20.240 --> 35:22.000
just to humiliate me, are you?

35:24.520 --> 35:26.440
What? Is it information that you want?

35:26.520 --> 35:30.560
Do you want to know about Sang Qi's plan

35:31.080 --> 35:34.080
or why did I slander Gao Fengxu?

35:34.160 --> 35:36.920
I want to ask what's the connection
of Sang Qi and my mother's death.

35:37.000 --> 35:39.760
Your mom died of giving birth.

35:39.840 --> 35:41.720
What's Sang Qi's role in this?

35:41.800 --> 35:44.560
I don't know what Su Ningzhen
has told you.

35:45.080 --> 35:46.280
All I know is that

35:46.360 --> 35:48.120
when you were born,

35:48.640 --> 35:49.840
Sang Qi was in seclusion.

35:49.920 --> 35:52.360
He couldn't have gone out
to hurt your mother.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.560
Why should I believe you?

35:58.000 --> 36:01.280
If you don't trust me, why come to me?

36:03.240 --> 36:06.440
Twenty years ago,
Sang Qi hasn't adopted me yet.

36:06.960 --> 36:08.880
I heard about this
from other Dark Clan members.

36:08.960 --> 36:12.520
Sang Qi was severely injured
and lost an arm.

36:12.600 --> 36:13.600
He was in seclusion for three years.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.280
That means

36:15.840 --> 36:17.360
he couldn't have gone to the human world.

36:18.000 --> 36:19.960
Sang Qi has lost an arm.

36:28.200 --> 36:29.360
Miss Gao,

36:31.360 --> 36:32.760
do you have more questions?

36:32.840 --> 36:34.160
Maybe it's time for you to leave.

36:34.240 --> 36:35.600
I need my rest.

36:36.120 --> 36:37.120
Mu Xuanling!

36:37.200 --> 36:39.680
Why do you always see me as an enemy?

36:45.240 --> 36:47.120
Because you are just like your father.

36:47.720 --> 36:51.040
You never remember
the vicious things you did to others.

36:51.760 --> 36:54.520
Make yourself clear.
What vicious things have I done to you?

36:55.320 --> 36:56.400
Weren't you the one
who were such a high-up

36:56.480 --> 36:58.320
and always bullied members
of the Spirit Clan?

36:58.400 --> 37:00.400
When Sang Qi, you switched clothes with me
so that I could die for you.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.920
Didn't you do that?

37:32.280 --> 37:33.120
Her eyes…

37:44.800 --> 37:47.320
You are that girl.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.520
See?

37:51.160 --> 37:52.160
You did forget it.

37:52.760 --> 37:54.000
That's how cheap my life is.

37:54.080 --> 37:56.040
I didn't forget. It's not like that.

37:56.120 --> 37:57.960
My father forbade me to be close
to Spirit Clan slaves.

37:58.040 --> 37:59.880
If I'm kind to anyone,
he would punish them.

37:59.960 --> 38:01.960
That's why I pretended
that I hated Spirit Clan slaves.

38:02.040 --> 38:03.600
As for sacrificing you,

38:03.680 --> 38:05.760
there were so many killings

38:05.840 --> 38:07.600
that I… I couldn't do anything back then.

38:07.680 --> 38:09.280
The elders arranged everything.

38:09.360 --> 38:11.440
When I realized what was happening,
I was taken away.

38:11.520 --> 38:13.480
I tried to save you,
but you had already been taken.

38:13.560 --> 38:15.760
Mu Xuanling.
I didn't want things to happen like that.

38:16.560 --> 38:17.400
Yes.

38:18.520 --> 38:20.600
You got all the advantages

38:21.120 --> 38:22.280
and the faults are always someone else's.

38:22.360 --> 38:24.400
You are always pure and innocent.

38:24.480 --> 38:25.640
My ladyship.

38:25.720 --> 38:26.960
Mu Xuanling!

38:31.080 --> 38:32.000
Miss Gao,

38:32.520 --> 38:33.560
Mr. Xie has ordered

38:34.240 --> 38:35.720
to keep Ms. Mu here for the time being.

38:35.800 --> 38:38.160
No unauthorized penalties.

38:39.040 --> 38:40.080
Did I do anything to her?

38:41.080 --> 38:43.200
Just a little reminder.

38:43.280 --> 38:44.720
You are not a member
of the Immortal Alliance.

38:44.800 --> 38:46.480
What gives you the right to protect her?

38:47.280 --> 38:50.080
Though the Greenview Heights
is not a part of the Immortal Alliance,

38:50.160 --> 38:53.640
someone in the golden essence stage
cannot offend us.

38:56.720 --> 38:57.840
Fine.

38:57.920 --> 38:59.560
For the sake of the Greenview Heights,

38:59.640 --> 39:01.760
I will let this one slide.

39:09.320 --> 39:10.160
Stupid and cowardly.

39:11.560 --> 39:12.800
Is that because of the demonic energy?

39:25.080 --> 39:26.640
I'll get some medicines for your wound.

39:26.720 --> 39:29.800
That will help with your recovery.
It might hurt a little, though.

39:31.920 --> 39:33.920
I don't think it could hurt more

39:34.000 --> 39:36.160
than being penetrated by demonic energy
or demonic energy dispersing.

39:39.920 --> 39:43.440
This is regeneration powder.
It speeds up wound recovery.

39:43.520 --> 39:44.880
But

39:45.800 --> 39:46.920
you will feel both painful and itchy,

39:47.000 --> 39:48.600
like you were bit by bugs.

39:49.360 --> 39:51.080
Maybe just let the wound be.

39:51.160 --> 39:53.320
Scars are like medals in the Spirit Clan.

39:55.240 --> 39:57.240
Do you want to try the decay powder?

39:57.320 --> 39:59.840
Your medals will look fancier.

40:02.680 --> 40:03.840
Mr. Nan

40:03.920 --> 40:07.040
is dashing and descent.

40:07.560 --> 40:09.680
Why do you have poisons so vicious?

40:09.760 --> 40:11.760
That's because

40:12.480 --> 40:14.280
I'm not such a decent person.

40:20.920 --> 40:24.080
Greenview Heights does have
surprisingly efficient medicines.

40:24.880 --> 40:26.200
I'm already feeling better.

40:30.280 --> 40:31.320
How much time do you have?

40:38.120 --> 40:39.200
About half a month.

40:40.760 --> 40:41.680
So,

40:42.560 --> 40:44.560
talk to Xie Xuechen.

40:45.200 --> 40:46.520
It is time to kill me.

40:49.440 --> 40:51.200
You already know

40:51.720 --> 40:53.720
that he's not the one who saved you.

40:54.880 --> 40:56.760
Yet you are still willing to die for him.

40:59.320 --> 41:00.880
I didn't know better.

41:02.600 --> 41:05.160
But when Ignorance Demon
detonated the golden essence,

41:05.240 --> 41:07.400
I was so scared.

41:09.120 --> 41:12.760
I was scared of the idea that
I couldn't find Xie Xuechen in this world.

41:17.000 --> 41:18.600
Other than him saving my life on that day,

41:18.680 --> 41:19.720
I guess

41:21.480 --> 41:23.240
I do have feelings for him.

41:28.240 --> 41:29.520
Anyway, I'm dying.

41:30.520 --> 41:32.400
Does this count as dying
in a foreign land?

41:33.360 --> 41:34.520
Never mind.

41:35.240 --> 41:36.680
I don't even know where my hometown is.

41:37.400 --> 41:38.800
How do I know where is a foreign land?

41:52.520 --> 41:55.560
What if I get you out of here?
Would you come with me?

41:58.960 --> 42:01.520
Greenview Heights
has unique medical knowledge.

42:01.600 --> 42:04.920
I can help you strengthen your body
and defend the demonic energy.

42:05.480 --> 42:08.080
My arrays are unparalleled in the world.

42:08.160 --> 42:10.960
You will not be found by anyone

42:11.040 --> 42:13.000
from the Spirit Clan, the Dark Abyss,
or the Immortal Alliance.

42:13.640 --> 42:18.600
Come with me
and you will live a normal life. Will you?

42:24.880 --> 42:27.040
How can Snow City answer

42:28.240 --> 42:30.080
to the other sects
if they lose an important inmate?

42:31.440 --> 42:34.200
If you stay, you will die.

42:35.320 --> 42:36.600
Are you willing to die

42:37.400 --> 42:38.880
to protect him?

42:46.800 --> 42:48.520
This is the path I've chosen.

42:49.720 --> 42:51.040
I stick

42:54.000 --> 42:55.160
to my decisions.
